        T("Gini", "Society and politics", "A measure of income inequality from 0 (everyone equal) to 1 (one person has everything).", "Moves with taxes, benefits, unemployment and policy. The Budget estimates its change before you commit.", "Society", new[] { "Poverty rate" }, new[] { "Inequality" }),
